sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Operator
    participant GUI as PC GUI<br/>(gui_c3_state_check_dual.py)
    participant App as Android App<br/>(BleLedApp)
    participant UNO as UNO Endurance MCU<br/>(uno_endurance_mcu_auto.ino)
    participant BLE as BLE Stack<br/>(Bleak / flutter_reactive_ble)
    participant A as Stock A FW<br/>(xiao_esp32c3_stock2.ino)
    participant B as Stock B FW<br/>(xiao_esp32c3_stock2.ino)
    participant LED as NeoPixel
    participant ADC as Battery ADC
    participant CSV as Endurance CSV

    Note over App,A: Normal BLE control flow (single stock)
    A->>LED: setup: init strips and clear
    A->>A: NimBLE init + service/characteristics + advertising start
    App->>BLE: scanForDevices(service UUID)
    BLE-->>App: discovered DEVICE_NAME
    App->>BLE: connect(deviceId)
    BLE->>A: connect request
    A-->>BLE: connected (or auth reject if strict security)
    BLE-->>App: connected
    App->>BLE: CMD_SET_OUTPUT_ENABLE / COLOR / RAINBOW / HEARTBEAT / PATTERN
    BLE->>A: write kCommandUuid
    A->>LED: apply solid or selected mode
    loop every ~10 ms
        A->>A: update pattern/heartbeat/rainbow/accel
        A->>LED: render frame
    end
    opt battery read
        App->>BLE: read kVoltageUuid
        BLE->>A: onRead(voltage)
        A->>ADC: analogRead + analogReadMilliVolts
        ADC-->>A: raw + mV
        A-->>BLE: 4-byte payload
        BLE-->>App: battery payload
    end
    App->>BLE: disconnect
    BLE->>A: onDisconnect
    A->>LED: output off and clear
    A->>A: restart advertising

    Note over User,CSV: Endurance flow (dual stock + power automation)
    User->>GUI: Start Endurance (cycles, waits, options)
    GUI->>GUI: Validate register baseline and reset counters
    opt MCU power automation enabled
        User->>UNO: run <cycles> <connect_wait_ms> <disconnect_wait_ms>
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] ENDURANCE_START / CYCLE_START
    end

    loop Cycle 1..N
        GUI->>BLE: Scan selected A/B devices
        BLE-->>GUI: scan result map

        par UNO power sequence
            UNO->>A: power OFF -> ON (A first)
            UNO->>B: power ON (after A->B delay)
            UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] SENSOR_ON_OK or SENSOR_ON_NG
        and GUI BLE test sequence
            GUI->>BLE: connectBoth()
            BLE->>A: connect + service discover
            BLE->>B: connect + service discover
            GUI->>A: startup wave + output commands
            GUI->>B: startup wave + output commands
            opt run_gatt_check
                GUI->>A: battery read / GATT check
                GUI->>B: battery read / GATT check
            end
            GUI->>BLE: disconnectBoth()
        end

        UNO->>A: power OFF
        UNO->>B: power OFF
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] SENSOR_OFF_OK or SENSOR_OFF_NG
        GUI->>GUI: classify PASS/FAIL and failure_class
        GUI->>GUI: update progress and counters
        alt FAIL and stop_on_fail
            GUI->>GUI: stop loop
            UNO->>UNO: stop
        else continue
            GUI->>GUI: next cycle
        end
    end

    GUI->>CSV: export endurance_report_*.csv
    GUI->>CSV: export endurance_report_summary_*.csv
    GUI-->>User: show report path and final summary
